hub.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/124107.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/124107.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-06T17:34:57Z"},"body":"By keeping a list of all the rollover results in a rollover request batch, we were keeping references to all the intermediate cluster states that we built. We've seen this list take up ~1.4GB with 600 rollover requests in one batch.\r\n\r\nWe only kept the list of results to compute the \"reason\" for the allocation reroute, so we can easily drop the cluster state reference from the list and only keep what we need.\r\n\r\nFixes #123893","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/124107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/124107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":16620990647,"node_id":"CE_lADOAAe_f86sWe1XzwAAAAPesDC3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/events/16620990647","actor":{"login":"nielsbauman","id":33722607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzIyNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33722607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman","html_url":"https://github.com/nielsbauman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsbauman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/